而 `launchToken` 是**内存态、每个进程随机生成**：

```js
function processLaunchToken(owner) {
    const created = encodeBase64Url(randomBytes(SECRET_BYTES));
    PROCESS_LAUNCH_TOKENS.set(owner, created);
    return created;

**所以磁盘上那份旧 cookie 到下次启动时已经完全作废，备份它毫无意义。**
